    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2243" root="برد" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَبْرُودٌ</span></b>  <i>Made,</i> or <i>rendered, cold</i> or <i>chill</i> or <i>cool:</i>
(S, Msb, K:) [and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُبَرَّدٌ</span></b>  signifies the same in an
intensive manner:] applied to water [&amp;c.: or
signifying <i>mixed with snow:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَدَهُ</span>]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَرَةٌ مَبْرُودَةٌ</span> <i>A tree deprived of its leaves by the
cold.</i> (AHn, M.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ مَبْرُودَةٌ</span> (M, A, K) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُبْرَدَةٌ</span></b>  (K) <i>Land,</i> or <i>ground, hailed upon:</i> (M,
K:) or <i>snowed upon.</i> (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرُودٌ</span>.

